# Choose exactly one template. See docs/ENTORNOS.md.
# local: .env.local.example -> .env.local (API + PostgreSQL)
# dev:   .env.dev.example   -> .env.dev   (all local integrations)
# prod:  .env.prod.example  -> injected production environment / SSM
# Legacy .env is no longer imported by Spring.
# Fixture hashes DEMO_PASSWORD_HASH, CANAL1_KEY_HASH and CANAL2_KEY_HASH
# are exported only for manual psql execution, never required to start the API.
